  choices = $EXPL$["Both taxpayers deduct the $3,800 in auto loan interest because the deduction applies to all vehicle purchases regardless of manufacturing origin","Harper may deduct the $3,800 auto loan interest as an above-the-line deduction because the vehicle meets the U.S.-manufactured requirement; Jensen receives no deduction because the imported vehicle does not qualify","Jensen deducts the interest while Harper does not, because the deduction is designed to encourage international trade and imported vehicle purchases","Both taxpayers deduct the interest, but Harper receives an additional above-the-line deduction as a double incentive for buying a domestic vehicle"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
