  choices = $EXPL$["Must ensure that the disbarred individual does not participate in practice before the IRS through the firm in any capacity","Has no obligations since the partner has already left the firm and is no longer associated with the practice","Must immediately notify all current clients about the disbarment regardless of whether those clients worked with the partner","Must dissolve the partnership within 90 days of learning about the former partner''s disbarment from IRS practice"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Circular 230 Section 10.24 requires that practitioners and firms take steps to ensure that disbarred or suspended individuals do not practice before the IRS through the firm. This includes ensuring the individual does not prepare returns, correspond with the IRS, or represent clients through the firm.
Wrong (B): The firm retains obligations under Section 10.24 even after the partner has departed.
