  choices = $EXPL$["A CPA should use professional judgment to determine the appropriate form of advice, considering the transaction''s importance, complexity, and need for a record","A CPA must always provide tax advice in writing, signed and dated, with copies retained in the client file for at least seven years","A CPA may provide tax advice orally only for matters involving less than $10,000 in potential tax liability to the client","A CPA must provide tax advice using standardized IRS-approved templates and formats prescribed by the Treasury Department"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
