  choices = $EXPL$["The CPA may allocate losses however the partners agree without evaluating the tax law requirements for the allocation","The CPA must allocate losses strictly in proportion to ownership percentages regardless of the partnership agreement terms","The CPA should decline the engagement because special allocations of partnership losses are inherently fraudulent under the Code","The CPA should evaluate whether the special allocation has substantial economic effect under IRC Section 704(b) before taking the position"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
